.TH SETGROUPS 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
setgroups \- sets supplementary groups, subject to capabilities and user namespace restrictions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int setgroups(size_t count, const gid_t* groups);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets supplementary groups, subject to capabilities and user namespace restrictions. This is a direct per-thread syscall.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setgroups (2)
